  "tier": 2,
  "text": "The magic of your oath ensures you always have certain spells ready; when you reach a Paladin level specified in the Oath of Devotion Spells table, you thereafter always have the listed spells prepared.\n\n##### Oath of Devotion Spells\n\n| **Paladin Level** | **Spells** |\n| 3 | *Protection from Evil and Good*, *Shield of Faith* |\n| 5 | *Aid*, *Zone of Truth* |\n| 9 | *Beacon of Hope*, *Dispel Magic* |\n| 13 | *Freedom of Movement*, *Guardian of Faith* |\n| 17 | *Commune*, *Flame Strike* |",
